  "scope": "# Review: front/back crossing-band prototype\nTask `7b0cb3b9a618` / `training:1a2e2828`; production generator v2.0.0; rule `20196c190154`.\nScope: one proposed, episode-fixed `target_layer={front,back}` parameter; canonical default `front`.\nBuilt: sampler, protected Racket labeler, demonstration-only rival checks, and public/private batch exporter.\nRepair: independent review found retry/count aliasing; one-slot retry advancement fixes the retained regression.\nChecks: **59 focused tests passed**; genuine pre-fix failure and final source hashes are retained.\nExamples: **2 complete episodes**, each with 3 demonstrations and 4 distinct queries; all 14 labels executed in Racket.\nSupplementary work: exactly two assigned tickets completed, one targeted probe each; no peer safety defect established.\nRemaining failures: none in the verified scope; finite rivals, bounded sampling, and 64 attempts remain explicit limits.\nReference rules: `front.rkt` is exact canonical program text; `back.rkt` is a separate proposed rule.\nDisposition: routine prototype handoff; variant adoption still requires an owner decision before production admission.\n",
